	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/video_settings/extra_effects/help_strings">
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="The overshield rises up the body and stays lit,\nin its own color. Online: the host's choice."/>
		<string text="Shields light their surroundings as they flare.\nOnline: the host's choice."/>
		<string text="Light Show: three times as far, at full from a\nthird of the flare. Online: the host's choice."/>
		<string text="Let explosions, plasma and the sun shine brighter\nthan white, then fit them to the screen."/>
		<string text="On an HDR display (Windows HDR on), show that\nlight truly brighter. From the next start."/>
		<string text="GT7: bright light turns white, as on film. Neutral:\nas drawn. ACES: more contrast. Reinhard: softer."/>
		<string text="With HDR Display, how bright white is, in nits.\nAuto: Windows' SDR content brightness."/>
		<string text="With HDR Display, your display's brightest, in\nnits. Auto: Windows' HDR calibration."/>
		<string text="Set Peak Brightness and Paper White by eye,\nwith patterns brighter than white."/>
	</strings>
